OL,3,GNEWSAFarewell to 'billboard' roof that
OL,4,Apointed to the past
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor decades it has been a familiar
OL,7,Fsight for drivers travelling along the
OL,8,FA6 near Matlock Bath in Derbyshire.
OL,10,FBut now the roof of the Homesford
OL,11,FTearooms - famous for its giant
OL,12,Flettering pointing to a pub that no
OL,13,Flonger exists - is about to be
OL,14,Fconsigned to history.
OL,16,FThe cafe's manager said they had been
OL,17,Fleft with no choice but to replace the
OL,18,Froof due to its poor condition.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
