OL,3,GNEWSAFarewell to 'billboard' roof that
OL,4,Apointed to the past
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork is already under way but there are
OL,7,Fplans to re-add giant letters once the
OL,8,Fwork is complete to keep the tradition
OL,9,Falive.
